  "description_blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Overview"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The product contains all the non-3D printed parts for assembling an entirely functional Push Opener (bottle opener）. To complete the work, you also need to download the model files and 3D print the remaining parts."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Creator Program: The Creator Program is a collaborative program between Bambu Lab and creators. Creators unleash their creativity to design 3D printing models, while Bambu Lab provides compatible hardware kits for those designs."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "To download the model files of the Push Opener (bottle opener) and obtain detailed information, please visit the Push Opener (bottle opener) on MakerWorld."
    }
  ],
  "description_html": "<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-stpc\"><!-- 第一条 -->\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\">\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\"></h3>\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\">Overview</h3>\n<p class=\"pct_p\">The product contains all the <strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">non-3D printed</strong> parts for assembling an entirely functional <strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Push Opener (bottle opener）</strong>. To complete the work, you also need to download the <strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">model files</strong> and <strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">3D print</strong> the remaining parts.<span data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></span></p>\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong><em><span style=\"color: #e60034; text-decoration: underline;\">Creator Program</span><span style=\"color: #e60034; text-decoration: underline;\">:</span></em></strong></span><strong><em> </em></strong>The Creator Program is a collaborative program between Bambu Lab and creators. Creators unleash their creativity to design 3D printing models, while Bambu Lab provides compatible hardware kits for those designs.</div>\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-tb\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-K4OCdHYOOop5aGxqeiFcWXYnnXe\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">To download the model files of the <strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Push Opener (bottle opener)</strong></span><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\"> and obtain detailed information, please visit the </span><strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Push Opener (bottle opener) </strong><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">on </span><a href=\"https://makerworld.com/zh/models/493676?from=search#profileId-407494\" rel=\"noopener\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\" style=\"color: #00ae42;\"><strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><u data-mce-fragment=\"1\">MakerWorld</u></strong></span></a><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">.</span></div>\n<!-- 第四条 -->\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\"></h3>\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\" data-mce-fragment=\"