8.6285px;\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">1</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" style=\"height: 19px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" style=\"height: 19px; width: 483.42px;\">\n<p>1.4x20mm Basic Rubber Bands (100PCS) - RA002</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" style=\"height: 19px; width: 48.6285px;\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">1</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- 第五条 --></div>\n</div>\n</div>",
